Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,raising our voices, we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to\Ngo, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go, get the sails all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure,\Nwe're itching to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunt them down wherever they may run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring them before your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A few miserable pirates are\Nno match for your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you pull it together\Nfor once, Captain John?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At least try to live up to the\Nreputation you had when you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Insufferable lout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master M, let's get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over there and fight\Nwith the other zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your commander orders you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to marry me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as your master commands\Nand play nice, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a human, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm marrying another human,\Nthat's the end of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, think about this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, you're a warthog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you're dead and rotting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly a match made in heaven here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's calm down and stop touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a marriage\Ncertificate, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You take that thing back\Nwherever you got it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you're saying,\Nbut keep moving those sexy lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting some animal carcass\Nhaunt me the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridal martial arts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Marital bell kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Lola, you've\Ngot to listen this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already found my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have a sharp tongue\Nand some bothersome friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but at the end of the day,\Nshe's human and she's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's all that really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to get rejected again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh look she's one of the pirates\Nthat's running amok on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll capture her when we\Ncapture the rest of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and finish her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop ruining my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Kumasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The risky brothers should be\Ndelivering the coffin as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up from them and take it straight\Nto our master over at the dance hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stare!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the Straw\NHead ship to clean out their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure collection while they're\Nbusy with all the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know if anything strange happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're much cuter when you\Nkeep that ugly mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, take care out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you just mumble something at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through with a delivery\Nfor our master. Yep, yep, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass, we dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, that's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever will the master\Nthink if it's broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, the lid came off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, they're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, half kill them, half dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we're OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, that guy, he cut us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have used the back of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it rained\Nwhile we were knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground's a bit wet. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is we're outside now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And those little squirrel guys dragged\Nus here in that coffin we were just in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it is a\Ncoffin. I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, turds, all three\Nof them are awake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's book it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought us to the\Nback of the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Hogback's lab was on the top\Nfloor, so they took us pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably good we woke up when we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, behind us, there's an even\Nbigger building on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That huge building was here the entire\Ntime, and we didn't even notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, chopper! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what\Nthis place is! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's hear it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a bridge that connects one building\Nto the other or more like a passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Passageway, it's kind of wide for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think there's even a forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kind of a forest and\Nkind of a bedroom or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,if they were dragging us through here\Nwhile we were passed out Then they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,must have been taking us to that other\Nbuilding for some reason or another!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably better that we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They were turning us into\Nzombies and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not going back in that coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, guys. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down for a second here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were running scared for so long, I\Nfeel like we're forgetting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to run! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My something freaky detector's\Ndetecting something freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be zombies coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something that\NJack in the Box said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, suckers, but there's\Nno treasure in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, I'm scared. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to come\Nup with a plan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as scared as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what your eyes are saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then which way are we running?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward or back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good question If\Nwe head back to the mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we might run into that\Nzombie samurai again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the other place might have\Neven tougher, even scarier guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think penguins are normally\Nforest animals, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Count off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Howdy, folks, they call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The penguin zombie duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Trio, we're a trio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the new guy. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And behind you is the rest of the crew\Nand what our friends the wild zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's meet them to a bloody!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Usopp, fire! Fire? Huh? Burn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are zombies too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack! Gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you! Chopper! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should worry less about your\Nfriends and a bit more about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're new here,\Nbut that girl's a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who this lady\Nis or where she came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even care if I have\Nto disobey a master's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even if it kills\Nme, I'll never kick a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem with\Nthat, then bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of crap zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid pig, just tell us where\Nyou hit our friends already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, ask all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:11:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get our cook back,\Nwe're making bacon out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they were strangled, and\Nso they can't call out for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No more predictions out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're way too depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When do we last see Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to screw around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody knows if\Nthere's armor laying around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you gotta put it on and wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like fulfilling a man's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me when you made a body out of\Niron you gave yourself a cold iron heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I have fists of iron,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that's no replacement for a\Nheart that's full of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, song time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Realizing I've lost something\Nso precious has blown
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a cold wind through the\Nrusty cracks of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this one Steel\NCyborg Traveler Blues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you forgot the situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a large\Nhall up ahead. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are Usopp and the others here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but take a look at this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be outside once\Nwe pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually a lot more\Ncomplicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't worry about the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out soon enough, since you've\Nconveniently walked right into our trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A haunted suit of armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It has spears piercing its body,\Nbut it's still moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So now the zombies are arming themselves\Ngreat because this wasn't bad enough
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you can use a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A little cut from a dead guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't gonna kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay down already. That guy's\Ndifferent. He's a lot tougher
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,than those knuckleheads we\Nbeat the crap out of earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will know real terror You'll see\Nwhat makes a zombie truly frightening Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,why are you way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't feel even a hint of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They never get tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And these zombie generals offer even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They all made quite a name\Nfor themselves in battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they died and were\Nbrought back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Among them are a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A wicked criminal. A samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And also a gunslinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagine the possibilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,These ruthless fighters combined with\Nthe relentless power of the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single member of your crew\Nis going to escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wall zombie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He locked us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can only move forward, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.56,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,speaking from experience\Nof fighting one zombie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,general I'd say we're in\Npretty deep crap here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's armor guides\Neverywhere trying to take
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,down these corpses one at\Na time doesn't seem like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the way to go but trying\Nto take them on all at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,once seems like an even\Ndumber idea this ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah you got a point and this\Nisn't even the fight we came
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in here for if we somehow manage\Nto escape this hall will most
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,likely end about side in the\Ncourtyard right and let's split up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and meet there be careful I don't\Nwant anyone else to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-six. Colubo Feetus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That move! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Scars on the back are the\Nshame of the Swordsman, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got scars on my entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You look different, but\Nyou are Zoro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me dumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what'll stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some unsafe lures?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And slam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he wasn't\Nable to make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because he's wearing that stupid\Narmor He blends it with the rest of them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless wait, you don't\Nthink he disappeared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you it's not a good\Nidea to wait and find
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,out the zombies will\Ncatch up to us any second
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up this box, Lydia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean Straw Hat's\Ninside of that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin, after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in that box, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you go and get\Nyourself caught like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, monkey, monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All those stories you've heard about\Nspider monkeys, you're looking at one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for a monkey, that's damn big!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me act this monster out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Got another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it hit the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you punks gonna do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out soon enough.\NSince you're gonna be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd be more worried\Nabout myself if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got me in front of you, and almond\Nwarrior zombies closing in from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for annihilation!
